.B $fpath
and installs them via
.B compdef
on the relevant command names. zshrs bundles zsh's stock completion
functions and its own additions inside the binary; any other corpus on
.B $fpath
(for example
.BR zsh\-more\-completions )
loads unchanged.
.SS "Authoring helpers"
.B _arguments
